msgstr "A Ticket is a request coming from outside, from a customer: the reply goes back by email or Telegram and the SLA clock runs. A Task is your team's own internal work: due date, checklist, dependencies. Both live in the same system, and you can create a task from a request in one click. You can switch on just one of them or both."

