msgstr "You have the right to find out what data we hold about you, correct it, ask for it to be deleted, withdraw your consent and object to processing. To do so, write to the email above. After confirming your identity we fulfil your request within the time limits set by law."

#: template-privacy.php
msgid "7. Məlumatın qorunması"
